### 3.7 Investigation & Collaboration

**Where:** Center, primary work area.

**Shows**

- Title + Live War Room presence (count, duration, avatars, typing)
- Tabs: Questions / Findings / Decisions (with counts)
- Question cards: expand, answers, discussion, decisions
- Live Activity timeline (side of workspace when space allows)

**Actions**

| Action | Behaviour |
| --- | --- |
| Switch tab | Filter lists via `getQuestionsForTab` |
| Expand question | Toggle body |
| Add answer / Submit / Cancel | Local state |
| View discussion | Toggle thread |
| Record Decision | Persist choice + history entry |
| Typing indicator | Mock “Sarah is typing…” |

**Mock:** `INITIAL_QUESTIONS` (Q1 open with answers, Q2 decision options, Q3 answered findings).

