## 4. Page states

| State | Layout / media |
| --- | --- |
| **Pre-Join-Ready** | Full IR layout; dock `prejoin`; Join Live; no video stage |
| **Live** | Dock `joined`; controls on; connection Connected |
| **No Media** | Live but camera off & no share — audio strip; collaboration full size |
| **Screen Sharing** | Stage visible (unless minimized); single sharer; dock `presenting` / `self-share` |
| **Reconnecting / Poor / Lost** | Status on dock; Retry when lost; content preserved |
| **Closed** | After Close Room — exit or read-only; media stopped |

Breadcrumb reflects state when useful (e.g. `Incident Room / Pre-Join-Ready` vs incident id).

