## 5. Theme (this page only)

- Header + Media bar: `--monosuite-color-chrome`, `chrome-raised`, `chrome-border`, `chrome-text`, `chrome-text-muted` (scheme-independent).
- Nested inset panels (answer quotes, rails): `--monosuite-color-surface-sunken`.
- Page background: `--monosuite-color-background`.
- No `#hex` / `rgba()` in app files; no `gray-0/1` page fills.

