## 7. Implementation checklist

When changing this feature:

1. Keep region map in §2 — do not collapse Attacker/Victim back into a single generic sidebar without updating this rule.
2. Port media behaviour from IWR before inventing new dock UX.
3. Extend `data.ts` mocks when adding UI sections (Chat, Evidence, Attacker/Victim).
4. Leave global status/colour grammar to `01` / `02` / `03`.
